that you're not on the you're not on&nbsp;
the right path or you're not doing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:50.240
what needs to be done and those things are just&nbsp;
entirely different regardless of whether or not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:59.280
regardless of whether or not you have&nbsp;
something to showcase in a moment it doesn't&nbsp;&nbsp;

